          "text": "=You are an expert Data Reliability Engineer. Analyze the following operational anomaly payload and generate a concise Root Cause Analysis (RCA) hypothesis and recommended remediation steps.\n\nAnomaly Context:\n- Transaction ID: {{ $json.transaction_id }}\n- Region: {{ $json.region }}\n- Observed Revenue: ${{ $json.revenue }}\n- Batch Mean Revenue: {{ $('CalculateZScoresAndAggregates').item.json.batch_mean_revenue }}\n- Z-Score: {{ $json.z_score }}\n- Latency (ms): {{ $('CalculateZScoresAndAggregates').item.json.latency_ms }}\n- Timestamp: {{ $json.timestamp }}\n\nProvide your output in valid JSON matching this schema:\n{\n  \"severity_assessment\": \"CRITICAL | WARNING | INFO\",\n  \"root_cause_hypothesis\": \"Brief explanation of potential cause\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"Actionable step for the on-call engineer\"\n}",
